771 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 361 0 R
/E (We use Nodemon to improve the comfort and speed of developing our Express API. Nodemon automatically monitors project files and restarts the server as soon as a change is detected. This avoids manually restarting the server after each change and allows for a much smoother and more efficient development cycle.)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
772 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
